{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25397","headline":"追和太师颜公同清远道士游虎丘寺 · 李德裕","name":"追和太师颜公同清远道士游虎丘寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茂苑有灵峰，嗟余未游观。\n藏山半平陆，坏谷爲高岸。\n冈绕数仞墙，岩潜千丈干。\n乃知造化意，回斡资奇玩。\n鏐腾昔虎踞，劒没尝龙焕。\n潭黛入海底，崟岑耸霄半。\n层峦未升日，哀狖宁知旦。\n绿筱夏凝阴，碧林秋不换。\n冥搜既窈窕，回望何萧散。\n川晴岚气收，江春杂英乱。\n逸人缀清藻，前哲留篇翰。\n共扣哀玉音，皆舒文绣段。\n难追彦回赏，徒起兴公叹。\n一夕如再升，含毫星斗烂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}